///     where point ids 0-4 are the five corner vertices of the pyramid; followed
///     by eight midedge nodes (5-12). Note that these midedge nodes lie
///     on the edges defined by (0,1), (1,2), (2,3), (3,0), (0,4), (1,4), (2,4),
